Aligned word-vector table (vectors.bin + vocab.txt)
===================================================

This directory contains a TRIMMED and QUANTIZED derivative of the fastText
aligned word vectors (French + English projected into a shared space).

Source:  fastText aligned word vectors
         https://fasttext.cc/docs/en/aligned-vectors.html
         Bojanowski et al., "Enriching Word Vectors with Subword Information";
         Joulin et al., "Loss in Translation: Learning Bilingual Word Mapping
         with a Retrieval Criterion".

